    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d270">

                <pb facs="0287" n="275" sameAs="frus:frus1942v05/pg275"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.154/132: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in the
                        Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Warren</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-11-05T22:00:00-04:00">November 5, 1942—10
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>348. Your telegram 480, November 3, 1 p.m. You are authorized to close road
                    agreement including Clause B–4<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi> as stated in
                    penultimate paragraph your telegram. Insert $200,000 in blank in paragraph <pb
                        facs="0288" n="276" xml:id="pg276"/> A 1 page 2. Forward signed original.
                    Please telegraph best estimate of number of kilometers of unbuilt portion of
                    Lago Enriquillo route which will be on public domain.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
